%% 07-images.mgp - learn MagicPoint on gucOS, deck 7 of 10 (todos/0202).
%% %newimage and its transforms, formats this port decodes, %valign.
%% The one seeded sample image is /usr/share/mgp/demo.gif.
%deffont "standard" tfont "/usr/share/fonts/mono.ttf"
%default 1 area 90 90, size 2, fore "white", back "gray20", font "standard"
%default 2 size 9, vgap 20, prefix " ", center
%default 3 size 5, fore "yellow", vgap 30
%tab 1 size 4, vgap 40, prefix "  ", icon box "SpringGreen" 50, left
%tab 2 size 3, vgap 40, prefix "      ", icon arc "gold" 50, left
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Images

deck 7 of 10: newimage and friends
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

\%newimage

%size 4, fore "white", left
one directive, the file in quotes:

%size 4, fore "gray70", prefix "   "
newimage "/usr/share/mgp/demo.gif"

%center
%newimage "/usr/share/mgp/demo.gif"
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Scaling

%center
%newimage -zoom 60 "/usr/share/mgp/demo.gif"
%size 3, fore "gray70", center
-zoom 60: both axes to 60% of the original
%center
%newimage -xyzoom 150 50 "/usr/share/mgp/demo.gif"
%size 3, fore "gray70", center
-xyzoom 150 50: width and height independently;
-scrzoom 50 scales against the SCREEN instead
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Rotation

%center
%newimage -rotate 90 -zoom 70 "/usr/share/mgp/demo.gif"
%size 3, fore "gray70", center
-rotate takes quarter turns: 90, 180, 270
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

In the text flow

%size 4, fore "white", left
an image is drawn as a line of its own, so
alignment applies to it exactly like text:
%right
%newimage -zoom 40 "/usr/share/mgp/demo.gif"
%size 4, fore "white", left
-raise N lifts an image against the baseline;
\%valign "top", "center" or "bottom" sets how
text sits beside a taller image on its line
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Formats in this port

	decoded: PNG, GIF, PBM/PGM/PPM, XBM, XPM
		an animated GIF shows its FIRST frame
	not here: JPEG, EPS - convert to PNG first
	icons can be images too:
		tab 1 icon "star.xbm" "white" 50
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

The end

%size 4, center
next: 08-backgrounds.mgp
